L1 Data Cache & LSU␀"°
L1TEX LSU ThroughputœCompare the LSUs two stages to classify the bottleneck.
If LSU Data-Stage > LSU Writeback, the bottleneck is in address processing â€” likely poor coalescing (global/local/surface) or bank conflicts (shared). Check per-space breakdown below.
If LSU Writeback > LSU Data-Stage, wide uniform loads (64/128-bit) or high miss traffic is saturating the writeback path â€” check L1TEX Tag-Stage Bandwidth per Hit Miss."}
