%L1TEX LSU Throughput per Memory SpaceÔIdentify which memory space drives high LSU throughput.
High LGDS wavefronts indicate heavy local/global/DMA/surface traffic.
High Shared wavefronts indicate shared memory is a significant portion of LSU traffic."‡
