SysL2 Bandwidth per Source UnitÓIdentify which unit is driving SysL2 traffic. If L1TEX dominates, SM data accesses are hitting the system-memory aperture â€” verify that the corresponding buffers are not inadvertently allocated in pinned/mapped host memory.
