SM Occupancy & Stalls␀"ì
Occupancy Detail¯Computed occupancy and thread-level activity. Warp Occupancy is a derived metric that accounts for achievable vs theoretical occupancy.
Thread Activity shows the fraction of threads active across warps â€” if much lower than warp occupancy, partial warps or divergence is reducing effective parallelism."Ù
