DRAM␀"¸
DRAM BandwidthÕDRAM bandwidth split by read and write direction. DRAM is half-duplex â€” reads and writes alternate, and direction changes cost cycles.
If the read/write ratio is roughly balanced, direction-turn overhead may be significant â€” check DRAM Read-to-Write Turns.
If one direction heavily dominates, the DRAM controller can batch efficiently and direction turns are minimal.
Compare DRAM bandwidth against gpu__time_duration to compute achieved GB/s for roofline analysis.␀"d
