Launch & Dispatch␀"ž
Warps LaunchedœTrack the rate at which new warps are placed onto SMs. Drops or gaps indicate stalls in the dispatch pipeline or periods where no new work is available. Cross-reference with Blocks Launched and engine activity to distinguish supply-side (dispatch) from demand-side (occupancy) limits."m
7pmsampling:tpc__warps_launched_shader_cs.sum.per_secondTotal Warps LaunchedJgb20y_TriageCompute_sampling"Ó
Warps ActiveÎThe live count of warps occupying SM slots. If Average Warps Active per SM is low (under ~4), the GPU is severely underfilled â€” increase the grid size or block count. If warp count is moderate but SM throughput is still low, the bottleneck is likely warp stalls, not occupancy â€” see SM Occupancy & Stalls for stall classification."¿
5TriageCompute.tpc__warps_active.avg.per_cycle_elapsedAverage Warps Active per SMJgb20y_TriageCompute_samplingi␀␀␀␀␀␀à?zÁTriageCompute.tpc__warps_active = CounterMetric(RerollUp(smsp__warps_active, RollupOp.sum, HwUnit.tpc), 'cumulative # of warps in flight') TriageCompute.tpc__warps_active:SetSustainedRate(96.0)"­
5TriageCompute.tpc__warps_active.sum.per_cycle_elapsedTotal Warps ActiveJgb20y_TriageCompute_samplingzÁTriageCompute.tpc__warps_active = CounterMetric(RerollUp(smsp__warps_active, RollupOp.sum, HwUnit.tpc), 'cumulative # of warps in flight') TriageCompute.tpc__warps_active:SetSustainedRate(96.0)"°
Blocks LaunchedƒTrack the rate at which thread blocks (CTAs) are launched onto SMs. Drops or pauses reveal dispatch-pipeline stalls. If block launch rate is steady but occupancy is low, the blocks themselves may be resource-heavy â€” check Per-CTA Resource Usage for register or shared-memory pressure.
Compare Total Blocks Launched with Work Distributor CTAs Granted. If granted >> launched, the work distributor is pushing work faster than SMs can accept â€” resource exhaustion (registers, shared memory) is throttling launches."Õ
>TriageCompute.gr__ctas_launched_realtime.sum.per_cycle_elapsedTotal Blocks LaunchedJgb20y_TriageCompute_samplingzÝTriageCompute.gr__ctas_launched_realtime = CounterMetric(gr__ctas_launched_queue_sync_realtime + gr__ctas_launched_queue_async_realtime, '# of CTAs launched') TriageCompute.gr__ctas_launched_realtime:SetSustainedRate(1.0)"µ
CTriageCompute.gr_total_ctas_launched_realtime.sum.per_cycle_elapsedTotal Blocks Launched (All)Jgb20y_TriageCompute_samplingzÝTriageCompute.gr__ctas_launched_realtime = CounterMetric(gr__ctas_launched_queue_sync_realtime + gr__ctas_launched_queue_async_realtime, '# of CTAs launched') TriageCompute.gr__ctas_launched_realtime:SetSustainedRate(1.0)zÒTriageCompute.gr_total_ctas_launched_realtime = CounterMetric(TriageCompute.gr__ctas_launched_realtime + gr__workids_granted_as_ctas_realtime) TriageCompute.gr_total_ctas_launched_realtime:SetSustainedRate(1.0)"„
