Warp State (Not-issued Samples)­Aggregated warp stall samples for when the warp scheduler issued no instruction, per SMSP ID:Warp Slot ID combination. Each SM has four SM sub-partitions (SMSPs). A sub partition has a fixed number of warp slots to which the scheduler assigns warps. Right-click the header to filter the stall reasons.SMSP ID:Warp Slot ID"	# Samples*6
