L2 ThroughputƒFind the L2 cache throughput limiter among its internal stages. The L2 serves all VidMem (device memory) aperture accesses between the crossbar and DRAM.
If L2 Sectors is the peak, raw request volume is the limiter â€” check L2 Throughput per Source Unit to identify the dominant source.
If XBAR-to-L2 or L2-to-XBAR is the peak, the crossbar interconnect between SMs and L2 is saturated."À
