L2 Hit MissÒOverall L2 cache hit vs miss throughput. If Lookup Miss is a large fraction of total, most L2 accesses pay full DRAM latency.
High miss rate + high L2 Sectors: the aggregate working set exceeds L2 capacity â€” consider tiling or blocking algorithms to improve temporal reuse.
High miss rate + low L2 Sectors: traffic is sparse but misses frequently â€” likely a scattered access pattern. Check L1TEX Tag-Stage Bandwidth per Operation for the problematic access type."~
