SysL2 Sector Hit Rate (Total)ùAggregate SysL2 hit rate. A low hit rate combined with high SysL2 traffic means the workload is paying system-memory latency on a significant fraction of accesses. This is a strong signal to migrate data from host/pinned memory to device-local DRAM."j
