C2C BandwidthßC2C (Chip-to-Chip) bandwidth by direction. C2C provides a high-bandwidth, low-latency link between GPU dies.
If C2C traffic is high during compute phases, check if data can be replicated locally to avoid cross-die accesses.␀"Z
