Blocks LaunchedƒTrack the rate at which thread blocks (CTAs) are launched onto SMs. Drops or pauses reveal dispatch-pipeline stalls. If block launch rate is steady but occupancy is low, the blocks themselves may be resource-heavy â€” check Per-CTA Resource Usage for register or shared-memory pressure.
Compare Total Blocks Launched with Work Distributor CTAs Granted. If granted >> launched, the work distributor is pushing work faster than SMs can accept â€” resource exhaustion (registers, shared memory) is throttling launches."Á
