Per-CTA Resource UsageÖCompare per-CTA resource consumption against hardware limits to identify the occupancy bottleneck. If Avg SMEM/CTA is close to SMEM Config, shared memory is the binding limit â€” reduce per-block shared allocation or use dynamic sizing. Cross-reference with SM Register Occupancy and SM Block Occupancy to confirm which resource limits first."î
ATriageCompute.tpc__average_sharedmem_bytes_per_cta_realtime.ratioAvg SMEM Bytes/CTAJgr10x_TriageCompute_samplingzöTriageCompute.tpc__average_sharedmem_bytes_per_cta_realtime = RatioMetric(tpc__l1tex_sram_bytes_mem_untagged_data_shared_allocated_compute_realtime, RollupOp.avg, tpc__ctas_active_realtime, RollupOp.avg, 671744.0, 'average shared memory per CTA')"¼
Shared Memory Allocation DetailîDetailed view of shared-memory SRAM allocation.
SMEM SRAM Lines shows how many L1TEX SRAM lines are dedicated to shared memory across resident CTAs.
