SM Tensor Pipe Breakdown™Identify which tensor instruction families.
If one sub-family dominates, the workload is specialized. If both appear, check whether mixed-precision conversions add overhead. If tensor throughput is low but expected to be high, verify the compiler is generating tensor instructions."˜
