 Warp Stall Reasons (All Samples)”Sampled distribution of reasons warps could not issue. The tallest stall category is the dominant bottleneck.
Long Scoreboard: warps waiting on memory (global/local loads) â€” improve data locality or increase occupancy to hide latency.
LG Throttle: load/store unit is full â€” reduce memory instruction density or improve coalescing.
Barrier: warps waiting at __syncthreads â€” reduce synchronization frequency or balance work across threads.
If no single stall dominates, the workload may be well-balanced or simply underutilized."`
