If SysMem traffic is large, data is crossing PCIe/C2C â€” allocate device-memory buffers and use explicit copies.
If PeerMem traffic is large, multi-GPU communication is a factor â€” check whether peer accesses can be batched or replaced with explicit transfers via NVLink/C2C.␀"v
