CGAs Launched & CompletedÆTrack Cooperative Grid Array launches and completions. CGAs coordinate multiple blocks that co-reside on the same GPC. If CGA launches are zero, the workload does not use this feature. If non-zero, compare launches with completions â€” a persistent gap hints at CGA scheduling overhead or resource contention at the GPC level."h
