ATriageCompute.l1tex__throughput.avg.pct_of_peak_sustained_elapsedL1TEX ThroughputJgb20x_TriageCompute_samplingzËTriageCompute.l1tex__throughput = ThroughputMetric({l1tex__sram_cycles_array_0_cmd_read,l1tex__sram_cycles_array_0_cmd_write,l1tex__sram_cycles_array_1_cmd_read,l1tex__sram_cycles_array_1_cmd_write,l1tex__data_pipe_lsu_wavefronts,l1tex__lsu_writeback_active,l1tex__data_pipe_tex_wavefronts,l1tex__f_wavefronts_realtime,l1tex__tex_writeback_active,l1tex__m_xbar2l1tex_read_sectors_realtime,l1tex__samp_wavefronts,tpc__l1tex_m_l1tex2xbar_req_cycles_active}, '')"ñ
