CGAs Active±The live count of active Cooperative Grid Arrays across GPCs. Low CGA residency relative to launches may indicate scheduling constraints or resource exhaustion at the GPC level."o
:pmsampling:gpc__cgas_active_realtime.avg.per_cycle_elapsedAverage CGAs ActiveJgb20x_TriageCompute_sampling"m
:pmsampling:gpc__cgas_active_realtime.sum.per_cycle_elapsedTotal CGAs ActiveJgb20x_TriageCompute_sampling*ø
Launch & DispatchÛLook for gaps, overlaps, and idle time between GPU engines.
If GR/Compute Active is low or intermittent, the GPU is starved â€” check Dispatch Cadence for submission gaps and Queue Stalls for synchronization overhead.
If Sync and Async Compute show little overlap, the workload may benefit from concurrent kernel execution across queues.
If Copy Engine activity overlaps with compute, verify whether host-device transfers are hiding behind useful work or creating contention."ˆ
Rpmsampling:gr__compute_cycles_active_queue_async.avg.pct_of_peak_sustained_elapsedAsync Compute ActiveJgb20x_TriageCompute_sampling"“
