GTriageCompute.sm__thread_inst_executed_pred_off_realtime.sum.per_secondThread-Inst Pred Off (All)Jgb20x_TriageCompute_samplingz„TriageCompute.sm__thread_inst_executed_pred_off_realtime = CounterMetric(RerollUp(smsp__thread_inst_executed, RollupOp.sum, HwUnit.sm) - sm__thread_inst_executed_pred_on_realtime) TriageCompute.sm__thread_inst_executed_pred_off_realtime:SetSustainedRate(128.0)"¨
